{"id":"wb-7-1380","name":"侬氏土司衙署","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"侬氏土司衙署","text":"侬氏土司衙署位于中华人民共和国云南省文山壮族苗族自治州广南县莲城镇北街115号，现为广南县第一小学校园。侬氏土司，始于元代，传为侬智高后裔，领广南西路宣抚司。明代，降为土同知。\n现存土司衙署建筑，重建于清末民国初年，有大门、二门、三门、正堂、签押房、代办房、五凤楼、家祠、白马庙等，占地1.1万平方米，衙署格局大致完整。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BE%AC%E6%B0%8F%E5%9C%9F%E5%8F%B8%E8%A1%99%E7%BD%B2","revisionId":94185169,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94185169","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f4590f7c43cff91672d3b900.jpg","title":"Main_Hall_Nongshi_Guangnan.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Main_Hall_Nongshi_Guangnan.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/Main_Hall_Nongshi_Guangnan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Xin","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​侬氏土司衙署正堂（议事厅）","width":320,"height":213}}